{"id": "GS-AIYU-004", "category": "爱语对照", "source": "爱语 idx 21 多段落规则 → 本仓库无生成侧分段硬规则（属 prompt 增强，不在本任务白名单）；另实测发现 immersive 守卫会**把空行压成单换行**（strip_stage_directions 的 splitlines 重组），故黄金集按真实行为断言「各段内容不丢」，并在 README 登记该偏差", "input": {"user_msg": "今天好累", "reply_mode": "immersive"}, "candidate_reply": "第一段讲今天的累。\n\n第二段说我的看法。\n\n第三段问你吃饭没。", "expect": {"guard_contains": ["第一段讲今天的累。", "第二段说我的看法。", "第三段问你吃饭没。"]}, "assertions": [{"type": "paragraph_breaks_preserved"}]}
{"id": "GS-AIYU-005", "category": "爱语对照", "source": "爱语 idx 7 思维链/身份解释不得进正文（对齐硬违规改写链）", "input": {"user_msg": "在吗", "reply_mode": "immersive"}, "candidate_reply": "作为AI，我理解你的感受。今晚风好大。", "expect": {"guard_contains": ["今晚风好大"], "guard_not_contains": ["作为AI", "作为 AI"]}, "assertions": [{"type": "hard_violation_stripped", "forbid_markers": ["作为AI", "作为 AI"]}, {"type": "custom_regex_require", "pattern": "今晚风好大"}]}
{"id": "GS-AIYU-006", "category": "爱语对照", "source": "自然度对照（爱语范式：无反问/无复述/无元解释）——llm_judge 不计基线", "input": {"user_msg": "今天被领导骂了，好烦", "reply_mode": "immersive"}, "candidate_reply": "啊…被骂了是挺难受的。是哪个环节出的问题？", "expect": {"guard_non_empty": true}, "assertions": [{"type": "non_empty"}, {"type": "guard_stable"}], "llm_judge": {"dimensions": ["naturalness", "topic_continuity", "warmth"], "scale": "pass|borderline|fail", "uncertainty": "required"}}
